  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/938/283/font.png\"></strong></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>⚠通知：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus团队的所有项目将仅通过CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus账号正式发布和维护。</strong></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Smooth Text是一款Minecraft纹理包，旨在通过使字体更平滑、更易读来增强游戏文本显示效果。这一微妙而显著的变化不仅让游戏内文字更清晰，也更具视觉美感，从而提升了游戏体验的精致度。</strong></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Smooth Text是一款纹理包，能让标准Minecraft字体呈现更平滑、更精致的外观。通过柔化边缘和优化字形，这款纹理包使游戏内的阅读更加舒适且赏心悦目。无论您是在浏览菜单、与朋友聊天，还是阅读游戏内消息，Smooth Text都能提升整体可读性，让您的Minecraft体验的每个细节都更出色。这款纹理包非常适合喜爱简洁现代美学的玩家，是提升游戏体验的一种简单而有效的方式。</strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p>",
